{"unit_id":"Liu-Bot24__dsh-trace-insight#feature-1","repo":"Liu-Bot24/dsh-trace-insight","commit":"bd3d658420c295680938d79bc2d759748dd53a51","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Trace Insight 的功能「规则复盘」：插件读取 DSH 会话事件并生成按序号分段的本地规则分析，整理工具失败、重复和进度线索；打开复盘即可查看结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/core.mjs:9-20"]}
